        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-813, Distressed Honey Dipper Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Honey Dipper Cabinet Pull is a classy way to add a bit of whimsy to your home. The fun shape is reminiscent of old-fashioned honey tools, giving this cabinet hardware a homey feel. It is available with either a 3 inch length or a 3-1/2 inch length in 5 different finishes. Comes packaged with the installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/beehive-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-714\"><b>Matching Beehive Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-813 Distressed Rod with Swirl End Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-813</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>CP-814</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/nickel-crab.jpg?v=1704354546\" width=\"497\" height=\"122\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
